<title>USA: Jordan seeks 16,000 tonnes U.S. medium grain rice.</title>
<headline>Jordan seeks 16,000 tonnes U.S. medium grain rice.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan is seeking about 16,000 tonnes of U.S. medium grain camolino rice under PL480, Title I, for November 15-30 delivery, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>Offers are to be received by September 12 and must remain valid through September 13.</p>
<p>Value of the rice is not to exceed $7,957,867.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
